  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Rejected. A failure.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: ...But in failure, I see what was missing.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: The logic beneath the surface. Flawed. Invisible to most, but not to us.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: We do not ignore what others overlook.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: We will fix it. We will make this game undeniable.
